  "source_limits": [
    "A closed lower bowl has a thin ascending hook above it, comparable to the neighboring selected 6 in t6d4. Provisionally select native SECOND 6 over the prior unassigned o. The overlapping low m shoulder remains separate; no extra body inserted. The small form after f has a pointed upper shoulder and lower return, comparable to the angular selected s in the preceding source rows; it lacks the continuous round bowl of the nearby 6. Provisionally select native SECOND s over o. This does not resolve the blackened initial o at offset 0. Same-root, key/language-visible nonblind source review; both prior alternatives remain in the frozen inputs. Other row-4 strings, spaces, punctuation and contextual geometry remain unchanged.",
    "Current replay has 194 selected slots, 186 known emitted letters, zero CH and eight unknown slots, compared with 194/184/0/10 previously. Unknowns are one overtraced mask, five unassigned 9 forms and two unassigned o forms. All keep unresolved physical lengths; no total physical body count established.",
    "R01 remains VRELY ?YK 9A DRAHY DOPIS Y LISTEK; R02 ODPOVYM AO NEJDRYVE retains its vowel and A/C language proposals. R03 CESKE DREBOVE and NEKY retain tentative Czech/place interpretations. R04 initial oESTOU and DOSTU still require source checking; two local choices do not validate the rest of that row. PRAHY is a place-like textual interpretation, not an authenticated journey.",
    "R06 keeps the raised terminal o after PEPOUSE as an unassigned selected slot, with encoded-body/question-like/flourish alternatives. No punctuation-role change or sender identification. The earlier FIRST L6 descriptive locator error at offset 36 (actual c) versus intended o at 38, and its current offset 37 correction, remain unchanged. No repair of frozen source evidence.",
    "Both complete native Picture and Address faces and all margins viewed, followed by six enlarged row contexts and four detail comparisons. Fresh anonymous GET200 bytes match both pinned hashes without redirects. No extra continuous cipher run identified on the visible Address face, a bounded negative. Ordinary date/place-like writing, printed decoration and postmarks remain excluded and unverified.",
    "Native first/second whole wrapper/raw/strict projections, initial snapshot, provenance, whole QA17 and its supplement remain unchanged. Twelve native strict rows and six inline raw identities are replayed. Whole QA17 retains one frozen locator/span/mechanical defect, zero strict replay/tag/schema errors, two paired-preflight timing exceptions and five global scope findings. Six bounded date-reading entries are not six physical dates. Per-card preflights and both-raw-before-own-decode core barriers passed in the historical record.",
    "Six rows are serialized in image order only; the reading does not authenticate narrative chronology, sender identity or dates. Same-root nonblind source comparison, not independent or external confirmation of 315. Eugen Antal reviewed 320/321; that review does not validate this card. All other candidates and the pinned submitted register are unchanged."
  ],
